        faq('What is the total data centre capacity in India in 2026?', 'About 1,575 MW according to the government (August 2026), 1,789 MW across the top seven cities according to Cushman & Wakefield (H1 2026) and 1,819 MW of IT load according to Savills. CBRE expects 2 GW by the end of 2026.', 'pib-cap', 'cw26', 'savills', 'cbre'),
        faq('Which city has the most data centres in India?', 'Mumbai, with 890 MW or about half of India’s operational capacity in H1 2026, most of it in Navi Mumbai along Thane-Belapur Road. Chennai is second with 214 MW.', 'cw26'),
